{"headword":"מָדַד","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. measure (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">מדד</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">مَدَّ</span> <em>extend, stretch</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">مُدٌّ</span> <em>a corn-measure</em>, etc.; Assyrian <em>madâdu</em>, <em>measure;</em> Jew.-Aramaic n. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִידָּה</span> <em>measure, proportion, rule</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ (מָדָ֑ד)</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.12\">Is 40:12</a> + 9 times Ez; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְדָדוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.15\">Ez 42:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.20\">20</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּמַדֹּתִ֫י</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.7\">Is 65:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וּמָֽדְדוּ</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.2\">Dt 21:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.10\">Ez 43:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וּמַדֹּתֶם</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:5\" href=\"/Numbers.35.5\">Nu 35:5</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫מָד</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:15\" href=\"/Ruth.3.15\">Ru 3:15</a> + 22 times Ez; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּמוֹד</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.3\">Ez 45:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּמֹ֫דּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:18\" href=\"/Exodus.16.18\">Ex 16:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּמֹ֫דּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.18\">Ez 47:18</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָמֹד</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 2:6\" href=\"/Zechariah.2.6\">Zc 2:6</a>;—<em>measure</em>, chiefly lit. (usually sq.acc. rei<em>;</em> obj. om. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:18\" href=\"/Exodus.16.18\">Ex 16:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.2\">Dt 21:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:35\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.35\">Ez 40:35</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.18\">47:18</a> (but v. Co); sq. acc. of measure <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:15\" href=\"/Ruth.3.15\">Ru 3:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.19\">Ez 42:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.3\">47:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.4\">4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.5\">5</a>);—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"measure of length, distance <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:5\" href=\"/Numbers.35.5\">Nu 35:5</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.2\">Dt 21:2</a> (D), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.5\">Ez 40:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.20\">20</a> + 32 times <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40-47\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40-47\">Ez 40–47</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 2:6\" href=\"/Zechariah.2.6\">Zc 2:6</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of dry measure <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:18\" href=\"/Exodus.16.18\">Ex 16:18</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:15\" href=\"/Ruth.3.15\">Ru 3:15</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig. of measuring waters <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.12\">Is 40:12</a> (of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>); of requital <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.7\">Is 65:7</a>."}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִמַּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:1\" href=\"/Hosea.2.1\">Ho 2:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.22\">Je 33:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִמַּדּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.37\">Je 31:37</a>;—<em>be measured</em>, of sand of sea <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:1\" href=\"/Hosea.2.1\">Ho 2:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.22\">Je 33:22</a>; of heavens <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.37\">Je 31:37</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּמִדַּד־</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Job 7:4\" href=\"/Job.7.4\">Jb 7:4</a> (cf. Ges<sup>§52, 2. R. 1</sup>); Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְמַדֵּד</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.2\">2 S 8:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְמַדְּדֵם</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.2\">2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמַדֵּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:8\" href=\"/Psalms.60.8\">ψ 60:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:8\" href=\"/Psalms.108.8\">108:8</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>extend, continue</em> (= make extent <em>or</em> continuation), subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶרֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 7:4\" href=\"/Job.7.4\">Jb 7:4</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>measure, measure off</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בַחֶבֶל</span>, of apportioning Moabites to death and life, sq. sf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.2\">8:2</a>; also obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲבָלִים</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.2\">2</a>; metaph. of conquest, sq. acc., <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:8\" href=\"/Psalms.60.8\">ψ 60:8</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:8\" href=\"/Psalms.108.8\">108:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חִלֵּק</span>)."}],"num":"2."}],"all_cited":true,"form":"Pi."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְמֹ֫דֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:6\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.6\">Hb 3:6</a> (subj. God, obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ</span>), <em>measured</em> (viz. with eye) 𝔙 Hi AV RV, but dub.; 𝔊 ἐσαλεύθη, 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲזִיעַ</span>, hence <em>shook</em> Ew Ke Or al. (from √ [<span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹד</span> =] <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹט</span>, but read then rather <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְמֹטֵט</span>, although <span dir=\"rtl\">מוט</span> not elsewhere in this conj.; We, plausibly, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְמֹגֵג</span> √ <span dir=\"rtl\">מוג</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:5\" href=\"/Nahum.1.5\">Na 1:5</a>)."}],"form":"Po."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּתְמֹדֵד</span> sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־הַיֶּ֫לֶד</span>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.21\">1 K 17:21</a> <em>measured</em> (= extended, stretched) <em>himself</em> upon the boy."}],"all_cited":true,"form":"Hithpo."}]},"rid":"BDB05086","strong_numbers":["4058","4059"],"next_hw":"מַד²","prev_hw":"מִדְבָּר³","root":true,"occurrences":"53","quotes":[],"GK":["4499"],"TWOT":["1146"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}